1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,914
Tracheids: long, tapering, lignified cells with bordered pits, and closed ends.

2
00:00:06,914 --> 00:00:10,247
Water seeps from one to the next through the pits.

3
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:17,187
They are found in all vascular plants, and in gymnosperms like pine they are the only conducting element.

